WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.012
Here is a simple decision rule for choosing among these objects.

00:00:04.012 --> 00:00:10.757
If the logic is needed only inside one query, a common table expression is usually enough.

00:00:10.757 --> 00:00:18.436
If many queries need the same reusable logic and they should always read current source data, use a standard view.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:24.507
If many queries need the same expensive summary, and some delay is acceptable,

00:00:24.507 --> 00:00:27.977
a materialized view may be a better choice.

00:00:27.977 --> 00:00:31.287
The best object is not the most advanced one.

00:00:31.287 --> 00:00:36.458
It is the one that matches the reuse, freshness, and performance requirements.
